        "name": "Mash 7 times",
        "crown": "Between games",
        "blurb": "After a game, the cards you played go back on top in a block, and the rest of the deck is already fairly mixed. Seven mashes break up that block and leave nothing behind for the tests to find. Six mashes usually do too, but not every time."
